sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Nguoi dung
    participant UI as React Web App (Google Identity SDK)
    participant Google as Google OAuth 2.0 Server
    participant Ctrl as AuthController
    participant Svc as AuthService
    participant Token as JwtTokenService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    User->>+UI: 1. Bam nut 'Dang nhap bang Google'
    UI->>+Google: 2. Yeu cau xac thuc tai khoan Google
    Google-->>-UI: 3. Cap Google ID Token (JWT ky boi Google RSA)
    
    UI->>+Ctrl: 4. POST /api/v1/auth/google { idToken }
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 5. AuthenticateGoogleAsync(idToken, ct)
    Svc->>+Google: 6. GoogleJsonWebSignature.ValidateAsync(idToken, ClientId)
    
    alt ID Token khong hop le hoac het han (BR-AUTH-07)
        Google-->>Svc: 7a. Throw InvalidJwtException
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 8a. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-AUTH-07", "MSG-AUTH-01")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 9a. 400 Bad Request: Token Google khong hop le
        UI-->>User: 10a. Hien thi thong bao loi xac thuc Google
    else ID Token hop le
        Google-->>-Svc: 7b. Return Payload { Email, Name, Picture, EmailVerified }
        Svc->>+DB: 8b. SELECT * FROM users WHERE LOWER(email) = @email
        
        alt Nguoi dung lan dau dang nhap Google (Chua co trong DB - BR-AUTH-02)
            DB-->>Svc: 9c. Return null
            Note over Svc: Tu dong tao User moi (Role = Citizen, IsGoogleAuth = true)<br/>Khoi tao UserEcoProfile (TreeLevel = 1, Points = 0)
            Svc->>DB: 10c. INSERT INTO users & INSERT INTO UserEcoProfiles
            DB-->>Svc: 11c. 2 rows affected
        else Email da ton tai trong he thong
            DB-->>-Svc: 9d. Return existing User
            Note over Svc: Cap nhat IsGoogleAuth = true & AvatarUrl (neu chua co)
            Svc->>+DB: 10d. UPDATE users SET is_google_auth = true, avatar_url = @pic
            DB-->>-Svc: 11d. 1 row affected
        end
        
        Svc->>+Token: 12. GenerateAccessToken(user) & GenerateRefreshToken()
        Token-->>-Svc: 13. Return AccessToken + RefreshToken
        Svc->>+DB: 14. INSERT INTO refresh_tokens
        DB-->>-Svc: 15. 1 row affected
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: 16. Return AuthResponseDto (MSG-AUTH-09)
        Note over Ctrl: SetRefreshTokenCookie(HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict)
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 17. 200 OK: ApiResponse<AuthResponseDto> (MSG-AUTH-09)
        UI-->>-User: 18. Dang nhap thanh cong vao he thong EcoLink
    end

